==English==

===Etymology===
Originally the simple past and past participle of {{m|en|wend}}, but now the past of {{m|en|go}} due to [[suppletion]].

While {{m|en|wend}} is akin to {{m|en|wind}}, compare typologically {{m+|ru|смота́ться}}, {{m|ru|сма́тываться}}, {{m|ru|умота́ть}}, {{m|ru|ума́тывать}} (akin to {{m|ru|мота́ть}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/wɛnt/|a=UK}}
** {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Pvanp7-went.wav|a=UK}}
* {{IPA|en|/wɛnt/|[wɛnʔ(t̚)]|a=US}}
** {{audio|en|en-us-went.ogg|a=US}}
** {{IPA|en|/wɪnt/|a=pin-pen}}
